\item{\code{files}}{object[]; never \code{NA}. As proteins read; search_database_sha256 is set: lower-case hex sha256 of the DECOMPRESSED database, so .xml and .xml.gz agree.}
\item{\code{column_names}}{string[]; never \code{NA}. source_index, source_path, then mzLib's GeneResolutionTsv.Schema headers in its order (a bridge test holds them equal).}
